    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At the heavenly spine, Shen Shang tells Shen Cong Sheng that from the killer move countless injury marks he deduced the Immortal Gu recipe of injury mark Immortal Gu. He refined it and replaced his own vital Gu. With this Immortal Gu, any attacks that cause damage to him convert into the respective injury marks. The more injury marks he has, the more he can increase the power of mutual injuries.",
